ty + speed\n- 1024 tiles may generate more detail, but also more \"creative noise\"\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Tiled Diffusion Info", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [481.96246337890625, 374.152099609375], "pos": [532.6771240234375, 1305.1734619140625], "id": 155, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "Denoise between 0.7-0.95", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [243.49609375, 30], "pos": [663.4285888671875, 729.4300537109375], "id": 156, "properties": {"padding": 5, "backgroundColor": "#2a220e", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 10, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 20, "fontColor": "#ffffff"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#fff0", "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "type": "Label (rgthree)", "title": "Flux txt2img with Upscaler", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fff0", "size": [466.796875, 40], "pos": [-890.4259643554688, 130.06040954589844], "id": 180, "properties": {"padding": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fontFamily": "Arial", "borderRadius": 0, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 40, "fontColor": "#f8a742"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n## ⚛️ Unet Loader (GGUF)\n### Download flux1-dev-Q8_0.gguf from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/city96/FLUX.1-dev-gguf/resolve/main/flux1-dev-Q8_0.gguf?download=true)\nOr choose a smaller version from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/city96/FLUX.1-dev-gguf/tree/main)\n\n**Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models` \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Dual Clip Loader (GGUF) 1️⃣\n\n###  Download t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q8_0.gguf from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/city96/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-gguf/resolve/main/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q8_0.gguf?download=true)  \n\n**Place in:** `ComfyUI/mode